It requires a lot of rock-juggling.

Hint 1:  The baby in the top center should be left alone.  

Hint 2:  Consider the situation with the baby in the top left.  It soon
gets into an impossible situation, doesn't it?  What happens if you
stop it before it gets into trouble?

Hint 3:  Consider the situation at the bottom sort-of-center of the screen.
You are never going to get those diamonds if you don't trap a baby there.
Where is the only baby that you can ever hope to have trapped there?

